OL,3,GNEWSAMum's Facebook kidney plea prompts
OL,4,A'mind-blowing' gift from total stranger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who shared a desperate plea for
OL,7,Fa kidney on Facebook has undergone a
OL,8,Flifesaving transplant after a stranger
OL,9,Foffered to be her donor.
OL,11,FKaren Davey, 41, had exhausted every
OL,12,Favenue before turning to social media,
OL,13,Fwhere she said she did not "want to
OL,14,Fleave her family without a mother".
OL,16,FGary Summerfield saw the mum-of-four's
OL,17,Fpost and, after learning he was a
OL,18,Fmatch, donated one of his kidneys via
OL,19,Fan operation in July.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
